{
  "resourceType": "Questionnaire",
  "id": "teleconsultoria-Mangara",
  "meta": {
    "profile": [
      "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire"
    ]
  },
  "extension": [
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "cnesAtd",
        "language": "text/fhirpath",
        "expression": "%resource.repeat(item).where(linkId='ATD.ES.CNES').answer.value.first()"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "estabAtdBundle",
        "language": "application/x-fhir-query",
        "expression": "Organization?identifier=https://saude.gov.br/fhir/sid/cnes|{{%cnesAtd}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "orgAtd",
        "language": "text/fhirpath",
        "expression": "%estabAtdBundle.entry.resource.ofType(Organization).first()"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "polosIds",
        "language": "text/fhirpath",
        "expression": "%orgAtd.extension.where(url='https://br-core.saude.gov.br/fhir/StructureDefinition/memberOf').value.reference.replace('Organization/', '')"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "polosBundle",
        "language": "application/x-fhir-query",
        "expression": "Organization?_id={{iif(%polosIds.exists(), %polosIds.join(','), 'sem-polo')}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "polosAtd",
        "language": "text/fhirpath",
        "expression": "%polosBundle.entry.resource.ofType(Organization)"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "poloRef",
        "language": "text/fhirpath",
        "expression": "%resource.repeat(item).where(linkId='ATD.ES.POLO').answer.value.reference.first()"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "poloSel",
        "language": "text/fhirpath",
        "expression": "%polosAtd.where(('Organization/' + id) = %poloRef).first()"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "locPoloBundle",
        "language": "application/x-fhir-query",
        "expression": "Location?organization={{iif(%poloRef.exists(), %poloRef, 'sem-polo')}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "locPolo",
        "language": "text/fhirpath",
        "expression": "%locPoloBundle.entry.resource.ofType(Location).first()"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "dseiBundle",
        "language": "application/x-fhir-query",
        "expression": "Organization?_id={{iif(%poloSel.partOf.exists(), %poloSel.partOf.reference.replace('Organization/', ''), 'sem-dsei')}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "dseiAtd",
        "language": "text/fhirpath",
        "expression": "%dseiBundle.entry.resource.ofType(Organization).where(identifier.where(system='https://saude.gov.br/fhir/sid/dsei').exists()).first()"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
      "valueMarkdown": "v0.2.0: acrescentado o estabelecimento do atendimento (ATD.ES), igual ao da teleinterconsulta v0.5.0 — CNES pré-preenchido com o do solicitante e editável; Polo Base escolhido entre os memberOf do CNES (substitui Organization.partOf) e gravado em Encounter.location (Location do polo); DSEI = partOf do polo. Pergunta /tele-Nao-aconteceu? passa a ter o texto 'Teleconsultoria não aconteceu?' (Y = não aconteceu), coerente com o linkId e com a teleinterconsulta; enableWhen invertidos. Sem polo: não exibe Polo nem DSEI. serviceProvider = HSL sempre."
    }
  ],
  "url": "https://ig.mangaradigital.org/apost-ig/Questionnaire/teleconsultoria-Mangara",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "name": "TeleconsultoriaMangara",
  "title": "Teleconsultoria – Mangará",
  "status": "draft",
  "date": "2026-10-22",
  "description": "Registro de teleconsultoria do Mangará, preenchido pelo teleconsultor, conforme o modelo de informação RNDS (RATC – Teleconsultoria – Teleconsultor).",
  "language": "pt-BR",
  "subjectType": [
    "Patient"
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "linkId": "TC.INF.DH",
      "text": "Data e hora da teleconsultoria",
      "type": "dateTime",
      "required": true,
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
          "valueMarkdown": "[1..1] Data e hora em que a teleconsultoria foi realizada."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "linkId": "SOL.ES",
      "text": "Estabelecimento Solicitante",
      "type": "group",
      "item": [
        {
          "linkId": "SOL.ES.CNES",
          "text": "CNES",
          "type": "string",
          "readOnly": true
        },
        {
          "linkId": "SOL.ES.NM",
          "text": "Nome do Estabelecimento",
          "type": "string",
          "readOnly": true
        }
      ],
      "readOnly": true,
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
          "valueMarkdown": "UC Passo 1: exibido, já preenchido a partir do agendamento (Appointment) / ServiceRequest – não editável. CNES = Organization.identifier (https://saude.gov.br/fhir/sid/cnes); nome = Organization.name. Serve de valor inicial do CNES do atendimento (ATD.ES.CNES). Polo Base não é mais exibido aqui: passa a ser confirmado no estabelecimento do atendimento."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "linkId": "/tele-Nao-aconteceu?",
      "text": "Teleconsultoria não aconteceu?",
      "type": "choice",
      "required": true,
      "answerValueSet": "http://terminology.hl7.org/ValueSet/v2-0136"
    },
    {
      "linkId": "/motivo-cancelamento-teleic",
      "text": "Motivo do cancelamento da teleconsultoria",
      "type": "choice",
      "required": true,
      "answerValueSet": "https://mangara.hsl.org.br/fhir/ValueSet/ReasonAusenciaTele",
      "enableWhen": [
        {
          "question": "/tele-Nao-aconteceu?",
          "operator": "=",
          "answerCoding": {
            "system": "http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v2-0136",
            "code": "Y"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "linkId": "ATD.ES",
      "text": "Estabelecimento do atendimento",
      "type": "group",
      "required": true,
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
          "valueMarkdown": "Confirma onde a teleconsultoria foi realizada. O CNES vem do solicitante (SOL.ES.CNES) e pode ser alterado. Com o CNES informado: busca Organization?identifier=https://saude.gov.br/fhir/sid/cnes|{CNES} e exibe nome, município e UF. Os Polos Base vêm da extensão memberOf (0..*, valueReference(Organization)) da Organization do CNES — substitui o uso de Organization.partOf. O usuário escolhe o Polo; na gravação, Encounter.location.location = Location cujo managingOrganization é o Polo escolhido (Location?organization=Organization/{id do polo}) (Se o CNES não tem memberOf, não são exibidos Polo nem DSEI e Encounter.location não é preenchido.) Encounter.serviceProvider é sempre o HSL (CNES 2079127), não o CNES do atendimento."
        }
      ],
      "enableWhen": [
        {
          "question": "/tele-Nao-aconteceu?",
          "operator": "!=",
          "answerCoding": {
            "system": "http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v2-0136",
            "code": "Y"
          }
        }
      ],
      "item": [
        {
          "linkId": "ATD.ES.CNES",
          "text": "CNES do estabelecimento do atendimento",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "maxLength": 7,
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-initialExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "%resource.repeat(item).where(linkId='SOL.ES.CNES').answer.value.first()"
              }
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/regex",
              "valueString": "^[0-9]{7}$"
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/entryFormat",
              "valueString": "0000000"
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
              "valueMarkdown": "Pré-preenchido com o CNES do solicitante (SOL.ES.CNES), editável. Se o renderizador não avaliar initialExpression sobre %resource no populate, o front-end copia SOL.ES.CNES para este campo na abertura do formulário."
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/questionnaire-constraint",
              "extension": [
                {
                  "url": "key",
                  "valueId": "atd-cnes-existe"
                },
                {
                  "url": "severity",
                  "valueCode": "error"
                },
                {
                  "url": "expression",
                  "valueString": "%cnesAtd.empty() or %orgAtd.exists()"
                },
                {
                  "url": "human",
                  "valueString": "CNES não encontrado. Verifique o número informado."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "ATD.ES.NM",
          "text": "Nome do estabelecimento",
          "type": "string",
          "readOnly": true,
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-calculatedExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "%orgAtd.name"
              }
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
              "valueMarkdown": "Organization.name da Organization do CNES do atendimento (%orgAtd)."
            }
          ],
          "enableWhen": [
            {
              "question": "ATD.ES.CNES",
              "operator": "exists",
              "answerBoolean": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "ATD.ES.MUN",
          "text": "Município",
          "type": "string",
          "readOnly": true,
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-calculatedExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "%orgAtd.address.first().city"
              }
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
              "valueMarkdown": "Organization.address.city da Organization do CNES do atendimento (%orgAtd). Se o cadastro trouxer só o código IBGE (extensão de município do BR-Core), resolver o nome do município no back-end."
            }
          ],
          "enableWhen": [
            {
              "question": "ATD.ES.CNES",
              "operator": "exists",
              "answerBoolean": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "ATD.ES.UF",
          "text": "UF",
          "type": "string",
          "readOnly": true,
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-calculatedExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "%orgAtd.address.first().state"
              }
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
              "valueMarkdown": "Organization.address.state da Organization do CNES do atendimento (%orgAtd)."
            }
          ],
          "enableWhen": [
            {
              "question": "ATD.ES.CNES",
              "operator": "exists",
              "answerBoolean": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "ATD.ES.POLO",
          "text": "Polo Base ao qual este estabelecimento pertence",
          "type": "reference",
          "required": true,
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-referenceResource",
              "valueCode": "Organization"
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-candidateExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "%polosAtd"
              }
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/questionnaire-itemControl",
              "valueCodeableConcept": {
                "coding": [
                  {
                    "system": "http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control",
                    "code": "radio-button"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-enableWhenExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "%polosAtd.exists()"
              }
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
              "valueMarkdown": "Opções = Organizations referenciadas em memberOf do CNES do atendimento, exibindo Organization.name. Mesmo com um único polo, o usuário confirma (pode vir pré-selecionado). Resposta: valueReference (Organization/{id}, display = nome do polo). Se o CNES não tem memberOf, não são exibidos Polo nem DSEI e Encounter.location não é preenchido."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "ATD.ES.POLO.COD",
          "text": "Código do Polo Base",
          "type": "string",
          "readOnly": true,
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-calculatedExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "%poloSel.identifier.where(system='https://saude.gov.br/fhir/sid/polo-base').value.first()"
              }
            }
          ],
          "enableWhen": [
            {
              "question": "ATD.ES.POLO",
              "operator": "exists",
              "answerBoolean": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "ATD.ES.POLO.LOC",
          "text": "Local (Location) do Polo Base",
          "type": "string",
          "readOnly": true,
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-calculatedExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "%locPolo.name"
              }
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
              "valueMarkdown": "Location com managingOrganization = Polo escolhido. Não é perguntado; exibido para conferência. Na gravação: Encounter.location.location = Location/{id}. Se não houver Location para o polo, sinalizar erro de cadastro."
            }
          ],
          "enableWhen": [
            {
              "question": "ATD.ES.POLO",
              "operator": "exists",
              "answerBoolean": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "ATD.ES.DSEI",
          "text": "DSEI",
          "type": "string",
          "readOnly": true,
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-calculatedExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "%dseiAtd.name"
              }
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
              "valueMarkdown": "DSEI = Organization.partOf do Polo escolhido (identifier https://saude.gov.br/fhir/sid/dsei); o vínculo Polo → DSEI continua em partOf. Não exibido quando não há Polo."
            }
          ],
          "enableWhen": [
            {
              "question": "ATD.ES.POLO",
              "operator": "exists",
              "answerBoolean": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
